WEBVTT

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.333
What?!

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.417
What happened?!

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:42.958
"Pon: Let's get moving. Hitech: Where? Pon: At our level? The port!
SSrPork: Huh? Just like that? Hitech: Risky, huh?"

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:44.917
"SSrPork: How bout you, Shroom? Hitech: With his skillz,
Mighty Shroom'll be AOK. SSrPork: You got mad confidence."

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:46.833
Pon: Shroom, hasn't moved for a while, huh? Hitech: Now that
you mention it... Pon: He fall asleep? SSrPork: Not again!"

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:47.625
"Hitech: SSr's pissed. SSrPork: No, I'm not. Pon: Wake up, Shroom!
Hitech: Someone wake him up! SSrPork: How?"

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.875
Takeo! Dinner!

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.792
"The Cursed Nightmare
I heard Takeo and Akira bought it."

00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:04.250
"Am I next?
I'm scared!"

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.000
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:37.958
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:45.375
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.083
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:52.917
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:01:52.917 --> 00:01:57.792
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:01:57.792 --> 00:02:03.208
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:08.417
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:12.333
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:16.250
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:21.458
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:26.583
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:30.292
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:36.792
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:02:36.792 --> 00:02:40.500
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:52.083
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:03:17.625 --> 00:03:18.917
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:18.917 --> 00:03:20.042
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Fifth Night"

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:22.042
"Dream Hell"

00:03:30.542 --> 00:03:33.792
I'll see you again if it's our fate.

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:45.625
So in the end, we only have
a hazy picture of things at best,

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:48.958
and the lightning bastard slipped outta sight.

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:52.792
What the heck was that?

00:03:52.792 --> 00:03:54.792
I don't believe a person turned into a demon.

00:03:54.792 --> 00:03:58.125
Could the other demons we
fought have been the same?

00:03:58.125 --> 00:03:59.125
No.

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:00.958
This one was different from
the other demons you have fought.

00:04:00.958 --> 00:04:05.375
It was a human with power who
had been intentionally transformed.

00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:08.250
Most likely, someone cast some manner of spell

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:12.292
which amplified that person's malice and hatred.

00:04:12.292 --> 00:04:15.958
Spell... You talkin' about that Dark Arts stuff?

00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:18.625
But who on Earth would do such a thing?

00:04:21.792 --> 00:04:23.625
That guy?

00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:26.458
In any case, this is not to
say that anyone with power

00:04:26.458 --> 00:04:29.375
will necessarily transform into a demon.

00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:34.125
That spell likely affects only
those with darkness in their hearts.

00:04:34.125 --> 00:04:36.500
Darkness in their hearts, huh?

00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:42.458
Is there anyone who <i>doesn't</i>
have any darkness in his heart?

00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:49.625
Still, this is our battle.

00:04:49.625 --> 00:04:52.000
We cannot give up.

00:04:54.375 --> 00:05:00.583
Most importantly, we cannot overlook
the innocent people being preyed upon!

00:05:03.917 --> 00:05:10.125
Aoi, it's hot! Help me, Aoi!

00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:13.375
Help me, Aoi...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.958
I want to save them,
every person I possibly can,

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:25.458
even the souls of those who
have become demons, and even...

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:28.083
I will fight!

00:05:28.083 --> 00:05:30.042
The little lady's got my vote.

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:36.417
Count me out.

00:05:40.292 --> 00:05:43.583
Are you guys totally out of it or what?

00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:45.583
You <i>saw </i>that demon, right?

00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.625
You guys are going to be
fighting things like that for real!

00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:49.875
Do you get that?

00:05:49.875 --> 00:05:53.625
Aoi... Aoi, you could <i>die</i>!

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:56.292
Let's stop this nonsense and go back to normal!

00:05:56.292 --> 00:05:59.250
Back to the school life we used to have!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.583
Okay? It's our long-awaited
summer vacation, right?

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:09.000
We promised each other we'd go
hang out at the pool or the beach, right?

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.625
Komaki...

00:06:10.625 --> 00:06:15.292
I understand, Komaki,
but this has already started.

00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:17.958
We're the only ones who can do it.

00:06:19.292 --> 00:06:22.917
You're always... always such
a little goody-two-shoes!

00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:25.792
Is saving people really that important to you?

00:06:25.792 --> 00:06:29.625
Even though you can't
protect anyone on your own?!

00:06:35.125 --> 00:06:38.542
Tono isn't the only one who's
having a tough time with this.

00:06:38.542 --> 00:06:43.333
It's... It's hard for me too.

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:44.958
I hate you, Aoi!

00:06:44.958 --> 00:06:46.125
Sa--!

00:06:50.542 --> 00:06:55.125
She'll be okay. Komaki will understand.

00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:58.167
So, is Anko still shut up in her house?

00:07:17.333 --> 00:07:22.792
The witnesses say the girl said
"dog" before she collapsed.

00:07:22.792 --> 00:07:25.208
Could she have dreamed it?

00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.458
Dog, huh?

00:07:27.458 --> 00:07:30.625
There's been a lot of weird
stuff going on lately, hasn't there?

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:35.208
Hey, did you hear the rumors?

00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:38.792
Yeah, it got Takeo too.

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:43.708
I guess it is his curse after all. I'm in deep shit.

00:07:43.708 --> 00:07:45.708
And now for the news...

00:07:45.708 --> 00:07:48.375
There have been a series of bizarre
incidents throughout the metro area,

00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:52.875
in which high school students have
been collapsing in a comatose state.

00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:55.250
As of now, the police are not
ruling out any possibilities

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.667
as they continue their investigation.

00:07:57.667 --> 00:07:59.750
However, there are still
many unanswered questions.

00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:07.042
Damn...

00:08:07.042 --> 00:08:10.583
Oh, no! Sakurai's not with it at all today!

00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:12.917
Maybe something happened to her over vacation?

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:15.458
You don't think she had
a falling out with Misato?

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:18.333
Ah, right! Lovers' quarrel, huh?

00:08:28.167 --> 00:08:30.542
For cryin' out loud, it's summer vacation!

00:08:30.542 --> 00:08:33.000
What's got you so down
you'd practice your club stuff?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.292
I'll never understand how you muscleheads think.

00:08:38.917 --> 00:08:42.958
Okay, so what's up? Did you drop
by for any reason in particular?

00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:46.625
You've probably been dwelling
on what Kisaragi said, right?

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:49.542
About "those with darkness in their hearts"...

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.125
You don't have to worry!

00:08:55.583 --> 00:09:01.792
Mejiro, Meao, Meguro, Meaka, Meki...

00:09:01.792 --> 00:09:06.000
Five small Buddhist shrines
which seal the demons away...

00:09:12.542 --> 00:09:14.250
Lady Aoi...

00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:24.792
I'm sorry, but she says she
just doesn't want to see you.

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:26.667
I see...

00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:47.583
Oh yeah? So, someone's adopted you, have they?

00:09:47.583 --> 00:09:49.167
Lucky you!

00:10:06.583 --> 00:10:08.042
That's...

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:27.708
"Aoi Misato"

00:10:28.875 --> 00:10:30.417
Aoi...

00:10:38.958 --> 00:10:40.292
"Tokyo Metropolitan Kagura
Middle School Yearbook"

00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:19.792
This is more interesting to me right now.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:26.667
Kyouko! She's coming here every day
to check on you, so at least say hi!

00:11:26.667 --> 00:11:28.792
I'm so sorry about her.

00:11:41.125 --> 00:11:43.833
Tono, it's Misato.

00:11:43.833 --> 00:11:46.875
Look, I'm really sorry about the other day.

00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:50.500
We must have really scared you.

00:11:52.958 --> 00:11:57.042
But don't worry about all that stuff!

00:11:57.042 --> 00:12:02.042
Uh, y'know, like Hiyu and Houraiji
flying and leaping around and stuff.

00:12:02.042 --> 00:12:04.042
That's nothing big.

00:12:04.042 --> 00:12:08.125
And Daigo and Komaki are totally normal, like...

00:12:08.125 --> 00:12:13.958
Not really normal at all, are they?

00:12:13.958 --> 00:12:18.583
Listen, we won't let you go
through anything like that again.

00:12:18.583 --> 00:12:24.625
We'll protect you no matter what, so don't worry.

00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:27.792
The pool opens tomorrow,
and everyone's looking forward to it

00:12:27.792 --> 00:12:31.875
since we haven't seen each other in a while.

00:12:31.875 --> 00:12:34.792
So, make sure you come too, okay?

00:12:37.833 --> 00:12:40.083
By the way, do you remember
back in middle school,

00:12:40.083 --> 00:12:43.708
when you were on Minami
Middle School's newspaper?

00:12:43.708 --> 00:12:49.250
I went to Kagura Middle School,
and you interviewed me for an article.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:52.625
I was so happy.

00:12:52.625 --> 00:12:55.625
Up until then, people were saying
I was the big honor student and all that,

00:12:55.625 --> 00:12:57.875
and it felt like a ton of pressure.

00:12:57.875 --> 00:13:00.375
Your article changed things for me,

00:13:00.375 --> 00:13:04.500
and I've wanted to be friends
with you ever since. I mean that.

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:17.375
"And down she goes!
Got some gum on her head, too..."

00:13:17.375 --> 00:13:20.292
"Caught in striking color:
Kagura Middle's own Madonna"

00:13:29.292 --> 00:13:31.417
This one too, huh?

00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:47.708
Hello, Misato residence.

00:13:47.708 --> 00:13:49.375
Kisaragi?

00:13:49.375 --> 00:13:51.792
I've got some business I need to take care of.

00:13:51.792 --> 00:13:55.125
I think it may be a while before
I'm able to contact you again.

00:13:55.125 --> 00:13:58.292
Anything new there?

00:13:58.292 --> 00:14:00.083
No, not really.

00:14:00.083 --> 00:14:02.542
Where are you right now, Kisaragi?

00:14:02.542 --> 00:14:05.250
There's a certain rare vase I am looking for,

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.875
so I'll be making the rounds
of the area antiques shops.

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:10.583
Another request from Dad, huh?

00:14:10.583 --> 00:14:13.333
All right, well take care.

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:45.417
Aoi...

00:15:07.292 --> 00:15:08.500
"Magami Academy"

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.958
Hey! Lookin' kinda bummed out there, champ!

00:15:10.958 --> 00:15:12.750
Morning.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:16.458
Listen, you two, I'm sorry about before.

00:15:18.458 --> 00:15:19.958
No big deal to us.

00:15:19.958 --> 00:15:21.125
On the other hand...

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:28.833
Long time, no see!

00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:29.833
Yeah!

00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:31.042
Go anywhere over summer break?

00:15:31.042 --> 00:15:32.875
I went to the beach!

00:15:44.458 --> 00:15:46.583
What's the matter?

00:15:46.583 --> 00:15:49.625
Speak... spoke... speaking...

00:15:49.625 --> 00:15:53.125
Have spoken... spoken... had spoken...

00:15:53.125 --> 00:15:56.708
I don't believe we gotta take remedial
classes on a nice day like this!

00:15:56.708 --> 00:16:00.375
This sucks, and what are <i>you </i>doing in here?

00:16:02.792 --> 00:16:04.500
I am teacher.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.917
You're student!

00:16:05.917 --> 00:16:08.792
Aww, hell! Lucky them!

00:16:08.792 --> 00:16:11.292
How come only the girls get to go swimmin'?

00:16:11.292 --> 00:16:13.125
I wanna go swimmin' too!

00:16:16.583 --> 00:16:21.333
Hiyu, your admissions test scores
put you in the top of your class.

00:16:21.333 --> 00:16:23.083
What happened?

00:16:25.083 --> 00:16:26.125
"Tiger Ninja Dragon"

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:28.125
"Shring!"
"Ninja"

00:16:30.583 --> 00:16:32.083
Ouch.

00:16:34.083 --> 00:16:35.750
Oh, whoa! Check it out!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:37.500
Captain, it's Sakurai!

00:16:43.125 --> 00:16:45.500
"Guide to the Carrots of the World
Tons of Super-Easy Recipes"

00:16:53.292 --> 00:16:55.708
Stop starin' at us, ya putz!

00:16:55.708 --> 00:16:57.792
Perverted old fart!

00:17:19.333 --> 00:17:20.917
Tono!

00:17:25.292 --> 00:17:26.917
Tono!

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:37.292
Me or Tono!

00:17:37.292 --> 00:17:38.708
Which is it?

00:17:40.792 --> 00:17:45.167
Spit it out! Me or Tono: who's more to you?

00:17:49.375 --> 00:17:51.125
Komaki...

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.500
Aoi...

00:18:35.625 --> 00:18:37.167
Aoi...

00:18:38.792 --> 00:18:41.125
We meet at last.

00:18:46.292 --> 00:18:47.792
Come, let's go.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.125
Come with me.

00:19:01.917 --> 00:19:02.875
Sto--

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.042
Deplorable!

00:19:08.042 --> 00:19:10.083
Aoi... Aoi!

00:19:10.083 --> 00:19:12.583
What is it? What's with you?!

00:19:12.583 --> 00:19:14.292
Ao...

00:19:14.292 --> 00:19:16.042
Aoi!

00:19:16.042 --> 00:19:16.667
Misato!

00:19:16.667 --> 00:19:18.292
--Snap out of it!
--Someone call an ambulance!

00:19:18.292 --> 00:19:20.167
--What's the matter, Aoi?!
--Someone call an ambulance!

00:19:22.167 --> 00:19:24.708
I might have known...

00:19:24.708 --> 00:19:26.958
Hey. Houraiji.

00:19:26.958 --> 00:19:29.958
Take her to Sakuragaoka Central Hospital.

00:19:29.958 --> 00:19:31.917
I'll take full responsibility.

00:19:31.917 --> 00:19:33.292
Huh?!

00:19:33.292 --> 00:19:34.917
But that place...

00:19:34.917 --> 00:19:38.000
Hey, how did you know anyway?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.292
This is no time to stand around arguing!

00:19:40.292 --> 00:19:42.792
Look, at this rate Aoi won't...

00:19:42.792 --> 00:19:43.958
Where to, Kyouichi?

00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:45.458
Oh, right!

00:19:47.042 --> 00:19:48.667
Misato!

00:20:09.917 --> 00:20:11.125
"Sakuragaoka Central Hospital"

00:20:14.917 --> 00:20:19.583
This place gives me a funny feeling.

00:20:19.583 --> 00:20:22.250
Figured it out? That-a-boy!

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.958
What? Is there something about this place?

00:20:24.958 --> 00:20:26.792
It just looks like an ordinary hospital.

00:20:26.792 --> 00:20:27.167
"Sakuragaoka Central Hospital"

00:20:27.167 --> 00:20:30.458
Personally, I'd rather be anywhere but here.

00:20:30.458 --> 00:20:33.292
See, there's someone here
I'm just no match for, period.

00:20:33.292 --> 00:20:35.833
Afternoon!

00:20:41.625 --> 00:20:45.292
Cripes, there aren't even any
patients here, let alone doctors!

00:20:45.292 --> 00:20:48.042
This place ain't gonna stay afloat for long!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.083
No... What's <i>that</i>?!

00:20:58.083 --> 00:20:59.792
Here she comes.

00:21:12.542 --> 00:21:16.333
Long time, no see, Kyouichi.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.167
Yeah!

00:21:19.167 --> 00:21:24.250
I heard from Inugami. He said you'd be by.

00:21:28.333 --> 00:21:31.000
Welcome!

00:21:34.625 --> 00:21:36.125
That girl!

00:22:11.333 --> 00:22:15.208
You look like you're having fun, Kozunu.

00:22:15.208 --> 00:22:18.583
Well, there's someone
I gave a new toy to, you see.

00:22:18.583 --> 00:22:22.458
Now, how will he dance for us?

00:22:25.208 --> 00:22:27.167
And this one, as well, huh?

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.417
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:52.500
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.667
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:08.667
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:08.667 --> 00:23:12.958
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.958 --> 00:23:14.792
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.083
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.083 --> 00:23:27.625
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.625 --> 00:23:32.042
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.208 --> 00:23:37.833
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:43.458
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.458 --> 00:23:47.833
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:53.125
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.125 --> 00:23:58.208
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:06.875 --> 00:24:07.958
"Next Episode"

00:24:10.625 --> 00:24:13.292
"Dark Arts Chapter Sixth Night Living Hell"

00:24:13.292 --> 00:24:17.046
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Sixth Night Living Hell"
